# Model weights: distribute via GitHub Release assets or Git LFS, not the repo.
*.pt
*.pth
# Exception for the Vercel backend build (backend/Dockerfile): our two trained
# weights are under GitHub's 100 MB limit and must be in the build. Delete these
# two lines and set WEIGHTS_BASE_URL instead to keep them out of the repo.
# SAM and yolov8n are downloaded at build time (backend/fetch_weights.sh).
!backend/best.pt
!backend/ultrabestroad.pt

